! =====================================================================
! STABILITY 3/3 (v1.24.0): the documented limitation must REFUSE.
!
! %stability requires a closed-shell restricted reference in this
! release (the module reuses the closed-shell TDDFT response
! machinery; UHF/UKS stability is a planned later stage).  A doublet
! forces %spin unrestricted through the auto-detection, so this input
! must stop at PARSE time with the specific diagnostic below -- a
! silent success here would mean a UHF wavefunction quietly analyzed
! with closed-shell formulas, which is worse than a crash.
! =====================================================================
%method  HF
%basis   sto-3g
%job     energy
%charge  0
%mult    2
%stability check
%geom angstrom
O   0.0  0.0  0.0
H   0.0  0.0  0.97
*end
